{"seq":2,"slug":"nonparametric","title":"非参数方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/survival-analysis/nonparametric","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kaplan-meier","title":"Kaplan-Meier 估计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/survival-analysis/nonparametric/kaplan-meier","wordCount":1336,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"log-rank-test","title":"Log-rank 检验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/survival-analysis/nonparametric/log-rank-test","wordCount":1425,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"nelson-aalen","title":"Nelson-Aalen 累积风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/survival-analysis/nonparametric/nelson-aalen","wordCount":1256,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"非参数方法\">非参数方法</h1><p>拿到一批生存数据，第一件该做的事不是训练复杂模型，而是直接「看」——这批人的生存曲线长什么样、两组之间有没有肉眼可辨的差异、累积风险随时间如何累积。非参数方法正是为这第一眼准备的：它们不假设任何分布形状、不要求线性、不需要比例风险，只让数据自己说话。它们既是探索性分析的起点，也是后面所有复杂模型的基准线——任何回归模型如果连非参数估计都跑不赢，那它一定哪里错了。</p>\n<p>这一章三篇文档对应三种最经典、最常用的无模型工具，分工清晰。</p>\n<p>第一篇「Kaplan-Meier 估计」讲如何在有删失的情况下，从数据直接估出生存函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的那条阶梯曲线。它是整个领域曝光率最高的图，论文、报告、产品留存看板上几乎随处可见。这一篇还覆盖它的置信区间与中位生存时间的读取，是单组生存描述的标准答案。</p>\n<p>第二篇「Log-rank 检验」回答「两组（或多组）的生存曲线差异是不是统计显著」。它把 Kaplan-Meier 的视觉差异转化为一个假设检验，是临床试验比较治疗组与对照组的默认武器。这一篇只讲组间比较的检验逻辑，不重复生存曲线本身的估计。</p>\n<p>第三篇「Nelson-Aalen 累积风险」从另一个角度——累积风险函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——刻画数据。它与 Kaplan-Meier 是一枚硬币的两面（通过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(t)=e^{-H(t)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 相连），在小样本与诊断分布形状时各有所长。这一篇专讲 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的估计与它独特的用途。</p>\n<p>三篇都建立在基础章的函数定义之上，建议读完 <a href=\"../foundations/survival-hazard-functions\">生存与风险函数</a> 再来。读完本章，你就能对任何生存数据做出像样的第一轮描述与比较；要把协变量纳入、做个体化预测，再进入回归模型章。</p>\n"}